# Generated by `node tools/preview.mjs`. The screenshots are kept as the visual
# record of a design; the HTML is regenerated from the same run and is bulky.
preview/*.html

# The "before" half of a redesign: a snapshot of a version that no longer exists.
# Rendered on demand with `--client=<old lib/client.js> --tag=before-x`, and kept
# off the published repository for the same reason as the changelog below.
preview/before-*.png

# The release record stays on the machine that cuts the releases. The published
# repository carries one initial commit, so a changelog would be the only trace
# of the versions before it — and the point of that commit is that there are none.
CHANGELOG.md
